comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-03T18:40:10.785Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: introduced a schema-versioned ExtensionContributionInventory that is parsed without importing extension modules and persisted after successful activation. Loader discovery merges manifest and managed snapshots; install results expose the derived inventory; SDK authoring exports and public-surface/schema snapshots are aligned. Static discovery now supplies commands, handlers, overrides, hooks, schema, parser, renderer, service, migration, importer/exporter, search/vector, and preflight surfaces."
  "2026-08-03T19:30:42.879Z","harness:codex","Exact-head PR evidence (PR #884, c361624e2): every hosted required check passes, including static/typecheck/coverage/smokes/compat, Ubuntu/macOS/Windows runtime smoke, benchmarks, CodeQL, Semgrep, Trivy, TruffleHog, DeepScan, CodeFactor, Codecov, ShellCheck, PSScriptAnalyzer, actionlint, and Docs/Skills. The complete sandboxed local suite passes 428 files / 6,792 tests at exact 100% statements, branches, functions, and lines; lint, zero-clone analysis, 100% docstring gates, contracts, and focused review regressions pass. All 12 CodeRabbit threads were individually replied to and reacted to; nine actionable findings were fixed in c361624e2 and all threads are resolved. The requested exact-head CodeRabbit rerun was included-review-rate-limited and the authenticated Greptile gate returned free_reviews_limit_reached; these are reviewer limitations, not clean-review claims."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-03T18:40:11.200Z","harness:codex","Design decision: manifest contributions are an optional ahead-of-time declaration while the managed install snapshot is mechanically derived from the real activation summary. Runtime discovery prefers precise inventory but retains conservative legacy fallback for packages not yet reinstalled."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-03T18:40:11.626Z","harness:codex",A contribution registry only removes startup imports when it is available before module evaluation. Persisting the activation result converts runtime knowledge into durable static context while install-time verification prevents hand-authored manifests from becoming trusted executable truth.
